{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classic series of strategy Flash games, re-implemented on a new engine and revitalized with thorough balancing, purposeful level design, and exclusive content.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Epic War 1</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take command in a dying world and build up your defenses while sending tactical waves of troops to overpower your enemy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old school artstyle. Resource management. Deceptively simple.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Epic War 2</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a massive army in battle and gain the upper hand by learning how to use each unit to its full potential.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick escalation. Story-rich. Faction warfare.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Epic War 3</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as one of 6 generals, tactically position your army and support it with magic to defeat your adversaries in a territorial war.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dynamic. Chaotic.\u00a0Simple.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Epic War 4</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble a team of heroes, recruit diverse creatures, and halt world-ending threats through cunning and creativity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nuanced. Strategy. Problem-solving.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Epic War 5</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey to defy calamity. Fight your way across hostile territory, strategically upgrade and gear up your ever-growing army.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventurous. Vibrant. Party growth.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >125+ units available to use</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ spells available to use</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 60 FPS</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Re-imagined experience with brand new content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varying combat styles and areas of focus from game to game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cloud saves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goblins</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1860580?t=1754235936","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860580/29cc9cfd698ab3c8260f86319518058d4777cca9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754235936","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860580/3572e4fc4bb2b315ca38e0a0b89556a50ae16835/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754235936","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860580/3572e4fc4bb2b315ca38e0a0b89556a50ae16835/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754235936","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classic series of strategy Flash games, re-implemented on a new engine and revitalized with thorough balancing, purposeful level design, and exclusive content.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Epic War 1</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take command in a dying world and build up your defenses while sending tactical waves of troops to overpower your enemy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old school artstyle. Resource management. Deceptively simple.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Epic War 2</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a massive army in battle and gain the upper hand by learning how to use each unit to its full potential.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick escalation. Story-rich. Faction warfare.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Epic War 3</h2><ul class=\